or_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Operator decision 2026-09-06: handle as part of the approved apply window.","timestamp":1788761467619817001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Milestone: documentation change landed through Gerrit change 2747. Local verification before push: make verify passed (lint, typecheck, and test). Gerrit labels reached LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1, no unresolved comments; submitted 2026-09-07 09:29Z.","timestamp":1788773388046210001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788047880492577718,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"751eeb88-a95b-4469-9c6e-bcff628c34cd","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1c0d-fe83-0254-444a"},{"link_uuid":"2454caf6-a196-4d77-93df-c7ba0d365a4b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"aef5-ee19-b837-4ddb"}],"description":"While rotating /rebar/prod/anthropic-api-key and re-materializing the container .env, a manual `docker compose up -d --force-recreate review-bot opcert mcp` on i-00880b2c7f13527c5 RACED the `rebar-autodeploy.timer` (which runs `docker compose` every ~2 min). The concurrent compose runs produced `Error response from daemon: No such container: <id>` and the manual `up` aborted partway, transiently leaving review-bot/opcert/mcp created-but-not-started (only gerrit up) — a self-inflicted ~1-2 min outage of the code-review bot, op-cert gate, and MCP server.\n\nRecovery that worked: `systemctl disable --now rebar-autodeploy.timer` → `docker compose up -d` → verify ps + `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` length in each consumer → `systemctl enable --now rebar-autodeploy.timer`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md secret-rotation / targeted-restart section documents the autodeploy-timer race and prescribes pausing `rebar-autodeploy.timer` for the recreate window (disable --now → up -d → re-enable --now), OR an equivalent lock so a manual compose op and the autodeploy tick cannot run concurrently.\n- [x] The `docker compose up -d --force-recreate <svc>` examples in that runbook cross-reference the pause step.\n\nNon-goals: changing autodeploy's cadence or adding a compose-level lock in autodeploy.sh itself (a heavier design change — file separately if wanted). This is a documentation/procedure fix.\n\n## Verification\n- Inspect `infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md` to confirm the secret-rotation/targeted-restart procedure explicitly pauses `rebar-autodeploy.timer` or an equivalent lock before manual compose recreates.\n- Run `env -u GIT_CONFIG_COUNT -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_1 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_1 -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_2 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_2 PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make verify` before Gerrit push and land the documentation change through Gerrit.\n\n\n## Implementation Plan\n- Edit only `infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md`.\n- Add an operator procedure warning that any manual `docker compose up -d --force-recreate ...` in the review-bot/opcert/MCP stack must first pause `rebar-autodeploy.timer`, then run compose, verify containers are up, and finally re-enable the timer.\n- Cross-reference that pause procedure from existing force-recreate examples instead of changing autodeploy cadence or adding a new lock.\n- If the existing runbook lacks a clearly matching targeted-restart section, add a small subsection near the secret-rotation procedure and link the examples to it.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","reason":"document the autodeploy timer race in secret-rotation / targeted-restart procedure and cross-reference the pause step from force-recreate examples"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","aef5-ee19-b837-4ddb"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"1ee608d9-1bb2-42ee-acca-bfac7f7d4835","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["ops","runbook","review-bot","mcp","autodeploy"],"ticket_id":"fd5d-cd3d-871e-4c51","ticket_type":"task","title":"Document autodeploy-race hazard in review-bot-ops secret-rotation procedure","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c7632abc-5857-43c1-b426-45316bb82e77","5f2ba857-9123-4d26-a800-1315806056c0","1858bf03-e80e-499b-8a8b-fa8f526da242","71dbae1f-7042-4ca6-8630-7bc9e021c4c2","39cb445d-14bb-406b-acfe-9d67cd9a9417","9a7644a3-840e-40d7-81be-1ae8d665bd3e","59b8f1d0-e8f7-4afb-afdc-838cfbfd60d2","2454caf6-a196-4d77-93df-c7ba0d365a4b","3eecaca3-3de9-421d-b64f-28ba72ca083f","8d50f177-c46a-4cea-bf54-d2c2ca7e07a4","1ee608d9-1bb2-42ee-acca-bfac7f7d4835","2953a28a-1815-42d0-bd7a-f939c3e7f4a9"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788783595268083761,"uuid":"a39364b4-1f76-42b9-8da1-690cd533e6c8"}